    {
      "knowledge_point": {
        "db_id": 17592186087671,
        "title": "Finding Exact Values of Trigonometric Expressions Using the Double-Angle Formula"
      },
      "question": {
        ":question/id": "284fa8b1-a821-55e3-a0ff-4cb6b704414a",
        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
        ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the **exact** value.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\cos^4\\left(15^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&\\quad -2\\cos^2\\left(15^\\circ\\right)\\sin^2\\left(15^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&\\quad +\\sin^4\\left(15^\\circ\\right)=\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n{{field-1}}",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Let $E$ denote the expression in the question. Recognize the expanded perfect square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE &= \\left(\\cos^2\\left(15^\\circ\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(15^\\circ\\right)\\right)^2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the cosine double-angle identity:\n\n$$\n\\cos^2\\left(x\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(x\\right)=\\cos(2x)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the angle and evaluate the standard-angle cosine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\cos^2\\left(15^\\circ\\right)-\\sin^2\\left(15^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(2\\cdot 15^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(30^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&= \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, square the value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE &= \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)^2 \\\\\n&= \\frac{3}{4}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        ":question/answer-fields": [
          {
            ":answer-field/id": "fb340e38-8dd4-5b77-a433-f4428ee9543a",
            ":answer-field/key": "field-1",
            ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/blank",
            ":answer-field/choices": [
              {
                ":answer/id": "17606882-795c-5b1c-bf33-dc12266ad96f",
                ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
                ":answer/value": "\\frac{3}{4}"
              }
            ],
            ":answer-field/correct": [
              ":answer/id",
              "17606882-795c-5b1c-bf33-dc12266ad96f"
            ]
          }
        ]
